# Task Manager

## Overview

A full-stack Task Manager application built with Next.js and TypeScript, designed to help users efficiently manage daily tasks. The application provides secure authentication, task management features, and a responsive user interface.

## Live Deployment

* Deployed on Vercel

## Backend Tech Stack

* Next.js (Server Side)
* TypeScript
* MongoDB
* JWT Authentication
* Nodemailer

## Backend Features

* MVC Architecture
* RESTful API Development
* JWT-based Authentication & Authorization
* Password Hashing using Bcrypt
* Temporary Token Generation using Crypto
* Nodemailer Email Integration
* Authentication Middleware (Proxy Middleware)
* CRUD Operations for Task Management
* Secure Password Reset Functionality

## Frontend Tech Stack

* Next.js (Client Side)
* TypeScript
* Redux Toolkit
* Bootstrap
* Material UI (MUI)
* HTML5
* CSS3

## Frontend Features

* State Management using Redux Toolkit
* Redux Slices for Modular State Handling
* Async API Handling with Redux Thunk
* Axios Interceptors for Automatic JWT Refresh Token Management
* Responsive UI using Bootstrap and Material UI
* Protected Routes and Secure Navigation

## Features

### User Authentication

* User Registration
